hen making this game, and also a love letter to what was once a first ever project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 weapon with few abilities that enhances the gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 maps - Act 1, 4 maps - Act 2, and 2 maps - Act 3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encore mode (Coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul>","developers":["CatgirlLydia"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/d2e5df2a977fb91eb7b35cbb6de9b71572d5d391/header.jpg?t=1761933809","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Phoenix Limit. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3563810/1900366204/705983bc8f5c1443196ba13f1532b357dfe50049/1761933344/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761933777","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3563810/1900366204/705983bc8f5c1443196ba13f1532b357dfe50049/1761933344/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761933777","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3563810/1900366204/705983bc8f5c1443196ba13f1532b357dfe50049/1761933344/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761933777","id":257225269,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2572